<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="zh-Hant"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="29822018"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="944321446"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="手写的从前"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="周杰伦"/><amll:meta key="album" value="哎呦，不错哦"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:57.564"><div begin="00:10.847" end="04:42.039"><p begin="00:10.847" end="00:15.235" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:10.847" end="00:12.842">這風鈴跟心動</span><span begin="00:12.842" end="00:14.111">很接</span><span begin="00:14.111" end="00:15.235">近</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这风铃跟心动很接近</span></p><p begin="00:15.843" end="00:20.450" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:15.843" end="00:18.034">這封信還在懷</span><span begin="00:18.034" end="00:19.185">念旅</span><span begin="00:19.185" end="00:20.450">行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这封信还在怀念旅行</span></p><p begin="00:21.180" end="00:25.179" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:21.180" end="00:23.037">路過的愛情都</span><span begin="00:23.037" end="00:24.238">太年</span><span begin="00:24.238" end="00:25.179">輕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">路过的爱情都太年轻</span></p><p begin="00:25.228" end="00:30.475" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:25.228" end="00:25.484">妳</span><span begin="00:25.484" end="00:26.188">是</span><span begin="00:26.188" end="00:27.531">我想要</span><span begin="00:27.531" end="00:28.119">再回</span><span begin="00:28.119" end="00:28.810">去</span><span begin="00:28.810" end="00:29.539">的風</span><span begin="00:29.539" end="00:30.475">景</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是我想要再回去的风景</span></p><p begin="00:31.271" end="00:35.292" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:31.271" end="00:33.345">這別離被瓶裝</span><span begin="00:33.345" end="00:34.563">成秘</span><span begin="00:34.563" end="00:35.292">密</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这别离被瓶装成秘密</span></p><p begin="00:35.740" end="00:38.815" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:35.740" end="00:37.394">這雛菊美得</span><span begin="00:37.394" end="00:38.029">像</span><span begin="00:38.029" end="00:38.461">詩</span><span begin="00:38.461" end="00:38.815">句</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这雏菊美得像诗句</span></p><p begin="00:38.825" end="00:43.810" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:38.825" end="00:40.665">而我在風中</span><span begin="00:40.665" end="00:41.069">等</span><span begin="00:41.069" end="00:42.843">妳</span> <span begin="00:42.843" end="00:43.302">的消</span><span begin="00:43.302" end="00:43.810">息</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而我在风中等你 的消息</span></p><p begin="00:44.045" end="00:46.783" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:44.045" end="00:45.153">等月光</span><span begin="00:45.153" end="00:45.665">落</span><span begin="00:45.665" end="00:46.115">雪</span><span begin="00:46.115" end="00:46.783">地</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等月光落雪地</span></p><p begin="00:48.292" end="00:52.134" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:48.292" end="00:50.210">等楓紅染秋季</span> <span begin="00:50.210" end="00:50.795">的</span><span begin="00:50.795" end="00:51.194">相</span><span begin="00:51.194" end="00:52.134">遇</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等枫红染秋季 的相遇</span></p><p begin="00:52.544" end="00:57.110" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:52.544" end="00:53.686">我重溫</span><span begin="00:53.686" end="00:55.588">午後的</span><span begin="00:55.588" end="00:56.288">陽</span><span begin="00:56.288" end="00:57.110">光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我重温午后的阳光</span></p><p begin="00:57.715" end="01:02.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:57.715" end="00:58.802">將吉他</span><span begin="00:58.802" end="01:00.667">斜揹在</span><span begin="01:00.667" end="01:01.283">肩</span><span begin="01:01.283" end="01:02.350">上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将吉他斜揹在肩上</span></p><p begin="01:02.523" end="01:07.584" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:02.523" end="01:03.931">跟多年前</span><span begin="01:03.931" end="01:04.514">一</span><span begin="01:04.514" end="01:05.167">樣</span> <span begin="01:05.289" end="01:06.480">我們輕輕</span><span begin="01:06.480" end="01:07.082">的</span><span begin="01:07.082" end="01:07.584">唱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跟多年前一样 我们轻轻的唱</span></p><p begin="01:07.689" end="01:10.915" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:07.689" end="01:08.665">去任何</span><span begin="01:08.665" end="01:09.136">地</span><span begin="01:09.136" end="01:10.915">方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去任何地方</span></p><p begin="01:13.989" end="01:18.694" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:13.989" end="01:15.438">我看著妳</span><span begin="01:15.438" end="01:15.992">的</span><span begin="01:15.992" end="01:16.544">臉</span> <span begin="01:16.662" end="01:17.909">輕刷著和</span><span begin="01:17.909" end="01:18.694">弦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我看着你的脸 轻刷着和弦</span></p><p begin="01:19.507" end="01:23.552" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:19.507" end="01:20.470">情人節</span><span begin="01:20.470" end="01:21.170">卡</span><span begin="01:21.170" end="01:21.743">片</span> <span begin="01:21.755" end="01:23.100">手寫的永</span><span begin="01:23.100" end="01:23.552">遠</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">情人节卡片 手写的永远</span></p><p begin="01:23.562" end="01:28.514" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:23.562" end="01:24.698">還記得</span><span begin="01:24.698" end="01:25.907">廣場</span><span begin="01:25.907" end="01:26.564">公</span><span begin="01:26.564" end="01:27.022">園</span><span begin="01:27.221" end="01:28.514">一起表演</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还记得广场公园一起表演</span></p><p begin="01:28.790" end="01:34.097" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:28.790" end="01:29.514">校園</span><span begin="01:29.514" end="01:30.116">旁</span><span begin="01:30.116" end="01:31.142">糖果店</span> <span begin="01:31.323" end="01:31.968">記憶</span><span begin="01:31.968" end="01:32.553">裡</span><span begin="01:32.553" end="01:33.301">在微</span><span begin="01:33.301" end="01:34.097">甜</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">校园旁糖果店 记忆里在微甜</span></p><p begin="01:34.405" end="01:39.110" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:34.405" end="01:35.854">我看著妳</span><span begin="01:35.854" end="01:36.408">的</span><span begin="01:36.408" end="01:36.960">臉</span> <span begin="01:37.078" end="01:38.325">輕刷著和</span><span begin="01:38.325" end="01:39.110">弦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我看着你的脸 轻刷着和弦</span></p><p begin="01:39.985" end="01:44.052" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:39.985" end="01:40.903">初戀是</span><span begin="01:40.903" end="01:41.610">整</span><span begin="01:41.610" end="01:42.082">遍</span> <span begin="01:42.116" end="01:43.477">手寫的從</span><span begin="01:43.477" end="01:44.052">前</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">初恋是整遍 手写的从前</span></p><p begin="01:44.062" end="01:48.905" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:44.062" end="01:45.024">還記得</span><span begin="01:45.024" end="01:46.303">那年</span><span begin="01:46.303" end="01:46.950">秋</span><span begin="01:46.950" end="01:47.400">天</span><span begin="01:47.572" end="01:48.905">說了再見</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还记得那年秋天说了再见</span></p><p begin="01:49.107" end="01:56.124" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:49.107" end="01:49.880">當戀</span><span begin="01:49.880" end="01:50.530">情</span><span begin="01:50.530" end="01:51.628">已走遠</span> <span begin="01:51.847" end="01:52.478">我將</span><span begin="01:52.478" end="01:53.007">妳</span><span begin="01:53.007" end="01:54.236">深埋在</span><span begin="01:54.236" end="01:54.929">心裡</span><span begin="01:54.929" end="01:56.124">面</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当恋情已走远 我将你深埋在心里面</span></p><p begin="02:15.640" end="02:17.993" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="02:15.640" end="02:15.856">微</span><span begin="02:15.856" end="02:16.108">風</span><span begin="02:16.108" end="02:16.842">需要竹林</span> <span begin="02:16.916" end="02:17.230">溪</span><span begin="02:17.230" end="02:17.447">流</span><span begin="02:17.447" end="02:17.993">需要蜻蜓</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">微风需要竹林 溪流需要蜻蜓</span></p><p begin="02:18.214" end="02:20.653" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="02:18.214" end="02:19.019">鄉愁般的離</span><span begin="02:19.019" end="02:19.437">開</span> <span begin="02:19.459" end="02:19.837">需</span><span begin="02:19.837" end="02:20.453">要片片浮</span><span begin="02:20.453" end="02:20.653">萍</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">乡愁般的离开 需要片片浮萍</span></p><p begin="02:20.839" end="02:23.412" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="02:20.839" end="02:21.097">記</span><span begin="02:21.097" end="02:22.033">得那年的雨</span><span begin="02:22.033" end="02:22.341">季</span> <span begin="02:22.351" end="02:22.817">回憶裡</span><span begin="02:22.817" end="02:23.284">特安</span><span begin="02:23.284" end="02:23.412">靜</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">记得那年的雨季 回忆里特安静</span></p><p begin="02:23.596" end="02:25.958" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="02:23.596" end="02:24.041">哭過後</span><span begin="02:24.041" end="02:24.567">的決</span><span begin="02:24.567" end="02:24.827">定</span> <span begin="02:24.827" end="02:25.336">是否還</span><span begin="02:25.336" end="02:25.786">能進</span><span begin="02:25.786" end="02:25.958">行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哭过后的决定 是否还能进行</span></p><p begin="02:26.189" end="02:28.240" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="02:26.189" end="02:26.824">我傻傻等</span><span begin="02:26.824" end="02:27.111">待</span> <span begin="02:27.111" end="02:28.065">傻傻等春暖花</span><span begin="02:28.065" end="02:28.240">開</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我傻傻等待 傻傻等春暖花开</span></p><p begin="02:28.428" end="02:30.934" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="02:28.428" end="02:30.063">等終等於等明等白 等</span><span begin="02:30.063" end="02:30.301">愛</span><span begin="02:30.301" end="02:30.934">情回來</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等终等于等明等白 等爱情回来</span></p><p begin="02:31.064" end="02:33.322" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="02:31.064" end="02:31.711">青春屬於</span><span begin="02:31.711" end="02:32.238">表白</span> <span begin="02:32.323" end="02:32.970">陽光屬於</span><span begin="02:32.970" end="02:33.322">窗台</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">青春属于表白 阳光属于窗台</span></p><p begin="02:33.631" end="02:35.924" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="02:33.631" end="02:35.547">而我想我屬於一個擁有妳的</span><span begin="02:35.547" end="02:35.763">未</span><span begin="02:35.763" end="02:35.924">來</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而我想我属于一个拥有你的未来</span></p><p begin="02:36.224" end="02:38.403" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:36.224" end="02:36.459">紙</span><span begin="02:36.459" end="02:36.752">上</span><span begin="02:36.752" end="02:37.374">的彩虹</span> <span begin="02:37.496" end="02:38.003">用素描</span><span begin="02:38.003" end="02:38.263">畫的</span><span begin="02:38.263" end="02:38.403">鐘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纸上的彩虹 用素描画的钟</span></p><p begin="02:38.667" end="02:40.923" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="02:38.667" end="02:39.028">我</span><span begin="02:39.028" end="02:39.368">還在</span><span begin="02:39.368" end="02:39.726">修改</span><span begin="02:39.726" end="02:40.424">回憶之中</span><span begin="02:40.424" end="02:40.784">妳的笑</span><span begin="02:40.784" end="02:40.923">容</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还在修改回忆之中你的笑容</span></p><p begin="02:41.264" end="02:43.897" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="02:41.264" end="02:41.563">該</span><span begin="02:41.563" end="02:41.947">怎麼</span><span begin="02:41.947" end="02:42.789">去形容</span><span begin="02:42.793" end="02:43.726">為思念醞釀的</span><span begin="02:43.726" end="02:43.897">痛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">该怎么去形容为思念酝酿的痛</span></p><p begin="02:44.029" end="02:46.071" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="02:44.029" end="02:44.766">夜空霓虹</span><span begin="02:44.766" end="02:45.949">都是我不要的繁</span><span begin="02:45.949" end="02:46.071">榮</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜空霓虹都是我不要的繁荣</span></p><p begin="02:46.393" end="02:48.650" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="02:46.393" end="02:47.239">或許去趟沙</span><span begin="02:47.239" end="02:47.512">灘</span> <span begin="02:47.632" end="02:48.520">或許去看看夕</span><span begin="02:48.520" end="02:48.650">陽</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许去趟沙滩 或许去看看夕阳</span></p><p begin="02:48.922" end="02:51.256" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="02:48.922" end="02:50.882">或許任何一個可以想心事的</span><span begin="02:50.882" end="02:51.122">地</span><span begin="02:51.122" end="02:51.256">方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许任何一个可以想心事的地方</span></p><p begin="02:51.510" end="02:53.718" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="02:51.510" end="02:52.645">情緒在咖啡館</span> <span begin="02:52.667" end="02:53.718">被調成一篇文章</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">情绪在咖啡馆 被调成一篇文章</span></p><p begin="02:54.075" end="02:56.416" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="02:54.075" end="02:56.416">徹底愛上妳如詩一般透明的淚光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彻底爱上你如诗一般透明的泪光</span></p><p begin="02:56.250" end="03:01.168" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="02:56.250" end="02:57.454">我看著妳</span><span begin="02:57.454" end="02:58.243">的</span><span begin="02:58.243" end="02:58.687">臉</span> <span begin="02:58.841" end="03:00.100">輕刷著和</span><span begin="03:00.100" end="03:01.168">弦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我看着你的脸 轻刷着和弦</span></p><p begin="03:01.594" end="03:05.471" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="03:01.594" end="03:02.664">情人節</span><span begin="03:02.664" end="03:03.306">卡</span><span begin="03:03.306" end="03:03.694">片</span> <span begin="03:03.776" end="03:05.208">手寫的永</span><span begin="03:05.208" end="03:05.471">遠</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">情人节卡片 手写的永远</span></p><p begin="03:05.758" end="03:10.710" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="03:05.758" end="03:06.894">還記得</span><span begin="03:06.894" end="03:08.103">廣場</span><span begin="03:08.103" end="03:08.760">公</span><span begin="03:08.760" end="03:09.218">園</span><span begin="03:09.417" end="03:10.710">一起表演</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还记得广场公园一起表演</span></p><p begin="03:10.906" end="03:15.927" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="03:10.906" end="03:11.553">校園</span><span begin="03:11.553" end="03:12.186">旁</span><span begin="03:12.186" end="03:13.363">糖果店</span> <span begin="03:13.526" end="03:14.149">記憶</span><span begin="03:14.149" end="03:14.728">裡</span><span begin="03:14.728" end="03:15.414">在微</span><span begin="03:15.414" end="03:15.927">甜</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">校园旁糖果店 记忆里在微甜</span></p><p begin="03:16.724" end="03:21.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42"><span begin="03:16.724" end="03:18.009">我看著妳</span><span begin="03:18.009" end="03:18.634">的</span><span begin="03:18.634" end="03:19.060">臉</span> <span begin="03:19.227" end="03:20.425">輕刷著和</span><span begin="03:20.425" end="03:21.210">弦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我看着你的脸 轻刷着和弦</span></p><p begin="03:22.065" end="03:25.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43"><span begin="03:22.065" end="03:23.039">初戀是</span><span begin="03:23.039" end="03:23.657">整</span><span begin="03:23.657" end="03:24.093">遍</span> <span begin="03:24.218" end="03:25.599">手寫的從</span><span begin="03:25.599" end="03:25.920">前</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">初恋是整遍 手写的从前</span></p><p begin="03:26.205" end="03:31.009" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44"><span begin="03:26.205" end="03:27.233">還記得</span><span begin="03:27.233" end="03:28.483">那年</span><span begin="03:28.483" end="03:29.095">秋</span><span begin="03:29.095" end="03:29.526">天</span><span begin="03:29.669" end="03:31.009">說了再見</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还记得那年秋天说了再见</span></p><p begin="03:31.252" end="03:38.037" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45"><span begin="03:31.252" end="03:31.793">當戀</span><span begin="03:31.793" end="03:32.676">情</span><span begin="03:32.676" end="03:33.718">已走遠</span> <span begin="03:33.899" end="03:34.624">我將</span><span begin="03:34.624" end="03:35.120">妳</span><span begin="03:35.120" end="03:36.390">深埋在</span><span begin="03:36.390" end="03:37.199">心裡</span><span begin="03:37.199" end="03:38.037">面</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当恋情已走远 我将你深埋在心里面</span></p><p begin="03:38.794" end="03:43.024" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46"><span begin="03:38.794" end="03:39.698">我重溫</span><span begin="03:39.698" end="03:41.549">午後的</span><span begin="03:41.549" end="03:42.202">陽</span><span begin="03:42.202" end="03:43.024">光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我重温午后的阳光</span></p><p begin="03:43.729" end="03:48.239" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47"><span begin="03:43.729" end="03:44.735">將吉他</span><span begin="03:44.735" end="03:46.556">斜揹在</span><span begin="03:46.556" end="03:47.172">肩</span><span begin="03:47.172" end="03:48.239">上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将吉他斜揹在肩上</span></p><p begin="03:48.610" end="03:53.590" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48"><span begin="03:48.610" end="03:49.888">跟多年前</span><span begin="03:49.888" end="03:50.581">一</span><span begin="03:50.581" end="03:51.118">樣</span> <span begin="03:51.234" end="03:52.462">我們輕輕</span><span begin="03:52.462" end="03:53.057">的</span><span begin="03:53.057" end="03:53.590">唱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跟多年前一样 我们轻轻的唱</span></p><p begin="03:53.764" end="03:56.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49"><span begin="03:53.764" end="03:54.637">去任何</span><span begin="03:54.637" end="03:55.021">地</span><span begin="03:55.021" end="03:56.990">方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去任何地方</span></p><p begin="03:59.992" end="04:04.478" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50"><span begin="03:59.992" end="04:01.392">我看著妳</span><span begin="04:01.392" end="04:02.028">的</span><span begin="04:02.028" end="04:02.427">臉</span> <span begin="04:02.539" end="04:03.847">輕刷著和</span><span begin="04:03.847" end="04:04.478">弦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我看着你的脸 轻刷着和弦</span></p><p begin="04:05.415" end="04:09.386" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51"><span begin="04:05.415" end="04:06.387">情人節</span><span begin="04:06.387" end="04:07.067">卡</span><span begin="04:07.067" end="04:07.577">片</span> <span begin="04:07.589" end="04:09.028">手寫的永</span><span begin="04:09.028" end="04:09.386">遠</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">情人节卡片 手写的永远</span></p><p begin="04:09.674" end="04:14.505" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52"><span begin="04:09.674" end="04:10.653">還記得</span><span begin="04:10.653" end="04:11.898">廣場</span><span begin="04:11.898" end="04:12.555">公</span><span begin="04:12.555" end="04:13.074">園</span><span begin="04:13.121" end="04:14.505">一起表演</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还记得广场公园一起表演</span></p><p begin="